<!-- Hero Wrapper -->
<div class="hero-wrapper merchants" style="background-color:#a2a2a2;font-size:18px;">

<!-- Second Row -->
<section class="container">
  <div class="container lg text-light">
   <div class="row">
     <div class="ten columns" style:"font-size:18px;">

         <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
         <p>Can't find what you're looking for? <a href="mailto:feedback@mapcat.io" target="_blank"><strong>Contact us</strong></a>!</p>
       <br>

         <button type="button" class="btn btn-info" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#button1"><strong>What is Mapcat?</strong></button>
           <br><br>
           Mapcat is an iPhone app that helps you find things near you.
           It maps where things are located in real world space like a corner store or restaurant.<br><br><br>


         <button type="button" class="btn btn-info" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#button2">How does Mapcat work?</button>
       <br><br>
           Download the app from the Apple App Store. When you open the app you'll see an empty search box.
           Type in something you are looking for. For best results try food related items in San Francisco.
           Mapcat will show you a list of places you can go to get the thing you're looking for.
          Tap on a search result or map pin that you like and a page will open to help you go there.<br><br><br>


         <button type="button" class="btn btn-info" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#button3">I didn't find what I was looking for!</button>
         <div id="button3" class="collapse">
       <br>
           Mapcat is a beta product right now, so sometimes things that you want may not appear.
           The first area we're covering is the City of San Francisco.
           The first vertical of things we've mapped are food related.<br><br>
       <br>

         <button type="button" class="btn btn-info" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#button4">Something is wrong with my app.
       </button>
         <div id="button4" class="collapse">
       <br>
           If you're having trouble with the app itself - it closes unexpectedly or you're not seeing
           any of the described screens, <strong><a href="feedback@mapcat.io" target="_blank">send us feedback</a></strong> and we'll help you out.

         </div>
       <br><br>


         <button type="button" class="btn btn-info" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#button5">How do I add missing things to Mapcat?</button>
         <div id="button5" class="collapse">
       <br>
           You have the power to add items to Mapcat!<br><br>
           <strong>Steps:</strong><br>
           <ul>
             <li>At the bottom of the first screen on your app there's a plus (+) sign.</li>
             <li> Tap the plus sign.</li>
             <li>You'll see a list of locations. Select the place you are at.<br></li>
           <li>Two ways to add an item:
              <ul><li>Select one the popular items listed</li>
                <li>Tap "New Item" and type in the name of the thing you want to add<br></li>
              </ul>
            </li>
           <li>Tap Submit. A confirmation message should appear on your screen.<br></li>
         </ul>
           You did it! The new item will be reviewed and then show up in the search if appropriate.
           Thanks for mapcatting!<br><br>
         </div>
       <br>


         <button type="button" class="btn btn-info" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#button6">Mapcat showed something was here, but it's not.</button>
         <div id="button6" class="collapse">
       <br>
        Ugh! Stock does change in stores. <strong><a href="feedback@mapcat.io" target="_blank">Send us a note</a></strong> and we'll update the information. Thanks for mapcatting!  </div>
       </div>

     </div>
   </div>
  </div>
</section><!-- End -->

